{
  "comment": "wb-021.2 (MW-ADAPTIVE-POLICY-ORGANIZATIONS-R2): the OUT-OF-FILE anchor of test/workbench-apo-snapshot-census.test.ts (the hk9l/5jha roster pattern). rows: every judged row of test/helpers/apo-snapshot-census.ts in census order (L, V, N, P, Z, R, S, Q) - id, label and, per pin, its id and the SHA-256 of the pin as written (its JSON: a live pin's kind, what and expected values; a plant's planted files, copies, expected views and findings; a reading pin's texts and readings; a seam pin's source and members). tests: every test the census file registers, in order. residuals: the named residual families and their pinned quiet rows. Written from the rows as measured at the cut; the census judges its rows, its registered tests (vitest task tree, run modes) and its residual families against this file at test time, in order and both ways.",
